      "answer": "Jin proposed a fast fix to avoid waiting on Okta change control by adding a preprocessing rule in Signal Ingest that maps the SCIM attribute \"businessUnit\" to \"department\" (or vice versa) and publishes a normalized field for the correlator. This is a configuration-only change that can be hot-reloaded, is low risk, and allows immediate normalization without modifying Okta flows. This hot-reloadable config change does not require appliance restarts and can be deployed quickly, avoiding the 2\u20134 week delay associated with standardizing at the identity source (Okta) [art_79f625aafa16]. \n\nThe exact date when Jin proposed this fast fix is not explicitly stated, but the call discussing it was after March 2nd and before March 20th, 2026 [art_79f625aafa16].",
